      "<a class=\"product-version\" data-current-version=\"([^\"@]+)\" href=\""
          + Pattern.quote(releases_url) + "\" " + EXTERNAL_LINK_ATTRIBUTES + ">v\\1</a>");

  @Test
  void headerLinksBrandAndFilteredVersion() throws IOException {
